--- 1. Root Cause Analysis ---
Problem A (Snip / Extract Image):
- Floating button #btnConfirmExtract is located inside #bgExtractBar (.stage-banner-bar), a child of #previewBox.
- previewBox pointerdown listener lacked exclusion for .stage-banner-bar, causing clicks on the floating button to trigger a new extraction drag, resetting bgExtractBox to 0x0 and capturing the pointer.
- confirmBgExtractMode() had an if/else ladder that called ImageToolsController.confirmBgSnip(box) and ignored executeBackgroundExtraction(box). confirmBgSnip only populated the drawer preview canvas without creating the image object on the canvas.
- stage.js line 873 enabled hidden button #btnConfirmBgSnip instead of visible button #btnCaptureSelectedArea.

Problem B (Background Crop):
- Full-size initial crop box locked translation math (init.w === ob.w).
- pointerdown on stage lacked drag-to-select mode when clicking uncropped full image or blank canvas.
- #cropBoxRect had fill rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.001) which rounded to 0 alpha in 8-bit color, causing browsers to treat it as unpainted during hit-testing.
- #stageOverlayLayer had pointer-events: none in CSS, preventing proper hit-testing of crop handles and rect.
- Missing explicit CSS cursor rules for .crop-mode-active.

--- 2. Modifications Applied ---
1. internal/web/static/index.html:
   - Added pointer-events="all" attribute to #cropBoxRect and fill="rgba(88, 166, 255, 0.08)".
   - Added pointer-events="all" attribute to all 8 .crop-handle elements.
   - Added pointer-events="all" attribute to #clipBoxRect and all 8 .clip-handle elements with fill="rgba(56, 211, 159, 0.08)".
2. internal/web/static/css/style.css:
   - Added .preview-wrapper.crop-mode-active and .preview-wrapper.clip-mode-active rules with explicit cursor: move for bounding rects, directional resize cursors for handles, and crosshair for stage.
3. internal/web/static/js/stage.js:
   - Added .stage-banner-bar pointerdown guard to prevent drag reset when clicking banner buttons.
   - Implemented drag-to-select mode (cropDragMode === 'select') when clicking uncropped full image or blank canvas.
   - Supported move and handle resize modes with live UI updates and drawer input synchronization.
   - Enabled stageOverlayLayer pointer-events in startCropMode and startClipMode; restored to none on cancel.
   - Fixed dynamic button enablement in pointermove for bg extract: enabled both #btnConfirmExtract and #btnCaptureSelectedArea.
   - Updated confirmBgExtractMode() to call both ImageToolsController.confirmBgSnip(box, { silent: true }) AND window.executeBackgroundExtraction(box).
4. internal/web/static/js/app.js:
   - Updated ImageToolsController.confirmBgSnip(box, opts) to support opts.silent = true, avoiding competing notification toasts.
   - Fixed trailing whitespace / newlines.
5. scripts/regression-harness.js:
   - Implemented Scenario 75 covering Snip / Extract execution parity, floating button non-inertness, banner bar click protection, and background crop selection, move, and handle resize manipulation.

